    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Penguin Noir takes inspiration from classic pinball games coupled with an intriguing and humorous mystery to uncover.</h2>Play as Giuseppe Squawks, a disgraced detective seeking to uncover the shocking truth behind his girlfriend\u2019s disappearance. Slide your way through a world full of icy twists and turns and rack up points in a combo while on your way to find out what the Seal Club Mafia did to Adelaide Anchovie!<br><br>Our game takes the classic gameplay of pinball and adapts it into fast-paced maze exploration.  Throughout each level, the player is tasked with collecting three pearls and keeping up a combo of actions that influence their movement. For example, the player can fire a gun that boosts them through the air with its recoil!<br><br>Controller Recommended. Supports Xbox Controllers, DualShock 4, and Keyboard/Mouse.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Penguin Noir takes inspiration from classic pinball games coupled with an intriguing and humorous mystery to uncover.</h2>Play as Giuseppe Squawks, a disgraced detective seeking to uncover the shocking truth behind his girlfriend\u2019s disappearance. Slide your way through a world full of icy twists and turns and rack up points in a combo while on your way to find out what the Seal Club Mafia did to Adelaide Anchovie!<br><br>Our game takes the classic gameplay of pinball and adapts it into fast-paced maze exploration.  Throughout each level, the player is tasked with collecting three pearls and keeping up a combo of actions that influence their movement. For example, the player can fire a gun that boosts them through the air with its recoil!<br><br>Controller Recommended. Supports Xbox Controllers, DualShock 4, and Keyboard/Mouse.",
    "short_description": "Penguin Noir is a fast-paced pinball-style arcade game where the goal is to collect three pearls throughout each level, maintaining a combo of explosive actions to rack up massive scores.",
